      "content": "thanks but rest doesnt really feel like the answer. it feels more like... a surrender. everything i write feels so fake because i'm still here, still stuck in this loop of living. i have this idea for a poem that explores how maybe the only way to actually achieve something pure and permanent is to let go of everything entirely. like, there's a certain kind of beauty in the finality of it, you know? that kind of absolute truth?",
